curely to the wall to save counter space while creating a stunning visual display of your favourite mugs and collectibles.\",\"language_tag\":\"en_IN\",\"marketplace_id\":\"A21TJRUUN4KGV\"},{\"value\":\"VERSATILE DISPLAY: Each individual cubby compartment neatly holds one mug, making it ideal for showcasing ceramics, pottery, small plants, or decorative items.\",\"language_tag\":\"en_IN\",\"marketplace_id\":\"A21TJRUUN4KGV\"},{\"value\":\"TIMELESS AESTHETIC: The classic grid-style design and natural wood tone complement a wide range of interior styles, from farmhouse to contemporary décor.\",\"language_tag\":\"en_IN\",\"marketplace_id\":\"A21TJRUUN4KGV\"}],\"manufacturer\":[{\"value\":\"Woodwolf®\",\"language_tag\":\"en_IN\",\"marketplace_id\":\"A21TJRUUN4KGV\"}],\"model_number\":[{\"value\":\"WW-MDR-25\",\"marketplace_id\":\"A21TJRUUN4KGV\"}],\"product_name\":[{\"value\":\"Wooden Wall Display Shelf - 25 Compartments (5x5 Grid), Natural Clear Matte Finish\",\"marketplace_id\":\"A21TJRUUN4KGV\"}],\"mounting_type\":[{\"value\":\"Wall Mount\",\"language_tag\":\"en_IN\",\"marketplace_id\":\"A21TJRUUN4KGV\"}],\"condition_type\":[{\"value\":\"new_new\",\"marketplace_id\":\"A21TJRUUN4KGV\"}],\"item_type_name\":[{\"value\":\"Wall Mounted Mug Display Rack\",\"language_tag\":\"en_IN\",\"marketplace_id\":\"A21TJRUUN4KGV\"}],\"generic_keyword\":[{\"value\":\"wooden mug display shelf, mug display rack, wall mounted mug shelf, mug collection display, pine wood shelf, 25 compartment shelf, 5x5 grid shelf, mug organizer wall rack, coffee mug holder, cup display shelf, wooden cubby shelf, rustic mug rack, farmhouse wall shelf, kitchen wall organizer, collectible display shelf, wooden storage shelf, natural wood wall shelf, coffee station decor, tea cup display shelf, decorative wall shelf, wall mounted organizer\",\"language_tag\":\"en_IN\",\"marketplace_id\":\"A21TJRUUN4KGV\"}],\"number_of_items\":[{\"value\":1,\"marketplace_id\":\"A21TJRUUN4KGV\"}],\"number_of_packs\":[{\"value\":