 The Marked Points, Insert Wall Plugs, And Secure The Shelf Using Screws. Ensure The Shelf Is Level Before Tightening Fully.\",\"language_tag\":\"en_IN\",\"marketplace_id\":\"A21TJRUUN4KGV\"}],\"item_depth_width_height\":[{\"depth\":{\"unit\":\"centimeters\",\"value\":10},\"width\":{\"unit\":\"centimeters\",\"value\":10},\"height\":{\"unit\":\"centimeters\",\"value\":90},\"marketplace_id\":\"A21TJRUUN4KGV\"}],\"item_package_dimensions\":[{\"width\":{\"unit\":\"centimeters\",\"value\":15},\"height\":{\"unit\":\"centimeters\",\"value\":15},\"length\":{\"unit\":\"centimeters\",\"value\":95},\"marketplace_id\":\"A21TJRUUN4KGV\"}],\"product_site_launch_date\":[{\"value\":\"2026-06-25T08:19:33.431Z\",\"marketplace_id\":\"A21TJRUUN4KGV\"}],\"recommended_browse_nodes\":[{\"value\":\"1380538031\",\"marketplace_id\":\"A21TJRUUN4KGV\"}],\"specific_uses_for_product\":[{\"value\":\"Home Decor Display, Plant Display, and Home Organization\",\"language_tag\":\"en_IN\",\"marketplace_id\":\"A21TJRUUN4KGV\"}],\"packer_contact_information\":[{\"value\":\"Manufacturer/Seller Contact Information Not Specified\",\"language_tag\":\"en_IN\",\"marketplace_id\":\"A21TJRUUN4KGV\"}],\"recommended_uses_for_product\":[{\"value\":\"Home Organization\",\"language_tag\":\"en_IN\",\"marketplace_id\":\"A21TJRUUN4KGV\"}],\"assembly_instructions_description\":[{\"value\":\"Wall-mounted Installation Required. Attach Mounting Hardware To Wall Studs Or Use Appropriate Wall Anchors. Align Shelf Bracket With Mounted Hardware And Secure In Place. No Additional Assembly Required As Shelf Arrives Pre-assembled.\",\"language_tag\":\"en_IN\",\"marketplace_id\":\"A21TJRUUN4KGV\"}],\"is_green_purchasing_law_compliant\":[{\"value\":true,\"marketplace_id\":\"A21TJRUUN4KGV\"}],\"supplier_declared_dg_hz_regulation\":[{\"value\":\"not_applicable\",\"marketplace_id\":\"A21TJRUUN4KGV\"}],\"rtip_manufacturer_contact_information\":[{\"value\":\"319, Sagar Complex, Joshonath Chowk, Bhavnagar, Gujarat - 364001\",\"marketplac