{"context":"ProductsService","level":"debug","message":"[DEBUG] Product: {\"id\":\"d225d0c5-b19c-47f2-9154-6347534c995f\",\"sku\":\"B0HCJD8CBP\",\"erpnextItemCode\":null,\"amazonAsin\":null,\"amazonFnsku\":null,\"amazonProductType\":null,\"upc\":null,\"flipkartSku\":null,\"thumbnailUrl\":null,\"name\":\"Woodwolf® Antique Color Wall Hook & Heavy Duty Coat Hook with Black Screws – Vintage Robe Hook for Entryway, Bathroom, Bedroom & Closet (4)\",\"description\":\"Add a touch of timeless elegance to your home with this beautifully crafted single wall hook, finished in a warm antique tone. Designed with a smooth, curved hook and an oval-shaped mounting base, this piece effortlessly blends classic charm with everyday practicality. The brushed finish gives it a vintage, aged appearance that pairs wonderfully with both traditional and contemporary interiors. Ideal for use in bathrooms, entryways, bedrooms, or kitchens, this hook is perfect for hanging towels, robes, coats, bags, and more. The sturdy construction ensures reliable support for daily use, while the two pre-drilled mounting holes allow for a secure and straightforward installation using standard screws. Whether mounted on tiled walls, wooden surfaces, or drywall, this hook stays firmly in place. Its compact yet functional design makes it a versatile addition to any room. Install a single hook or arrange multiple hooks in a row for a stylish and organised storage solution throughout your home.\",\"category\":\"BASE_PRODUCT\",\"brand\":\"Woodwolf\",\"uom\":\"Nos\",\"hsnCode\":null,\"gstRate\":\"18.00\",\"mrp\":\"0.00\",\"sellingPrice\":\"0.00\",\"costPrice\":\"0.00\",\"weight\":null,\"weightUom\":\"Kg\",\"images\":null,\"amazonRawPayload\":{\"asin\":\"B0HCJD8CBP\",\"images\":[{\"images\":[{\"link\":\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41o7LGkpFqL.jpg\",\"width\":463,\"height\":500,\"variant\":\"MAIN\"},{\"link\":\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41o7LGkpFqL._SL75_.jpg\",\"width\":69,\"height\":75,\"variant\":