 out beautifully. Whether placed in a living room, kitchen, or study, this wall shelf brings a touch of Scandinavian-inspired minimalism to your home décor. Easy to mount and built to last, it is an ideal choice for collectors and design enthusiasts alike who wish to display their treasured pieces with style and sophistication.\",\n        \"language_tag\": \"en_IN\",\n        \"marketplace_id\": \"A21TJRUUN4KGV\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"op\": \"replace\",\n    \"path\": \"/attributes/shelf_bracket_shape\",\n    \"value\": [\n      {\n        \"value\": \"Square Grid\",\n        \"language_tag\": \"en_IN\",\n        \"marketplace_id\": \"A21TJRUUN4KGV\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"op\": \"replace\",\n    \"path\": \"/attributes/is_assembly_required\",\n    \"value\": [\n      {\n        \"value\": true,\n        \"marketplace_id\": \"A21TJRUUN4KGV\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"op\": \"replace\",\n    \"path\": \"/attributes/assembly_instructions\",\n    \"value\": [\n      {\n        \"value\": \"Mount The Shelf On The Wall Using The Provided Hardware. Mark The Desired Position On The Wall, Drill Holes At The Marked Points, Insert Wall Plugs, And Secure The Shelf Using Screws. Ensure The Shelf Is Level Before Tightening Fully.\",\n        \"language_tag\": \"en_IN\",\n        \"marketplace_id\": \"A21TJRUUN4KGV\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"op\": \"replace\",\n    \"path\": \"/attributes/item_depth_width_height\",\n    \"value\": [\n      {\n        \"depth\": {\n          \"unit\": \"centimeters\",\n          \"value\": 9\n        },\n        \"width\": {\n          \"unit\": \"centimeters\",\n          \"value\": 53.34\n        },\n        \"height\": {\n          \"unit\": \"centimeters\",\n          \"value\": 66.04\n        },\n        \"marketplace_id\": \"A21TJRUUN4KGV\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"op\": \"replace\",\n    \"path\": \"/attributes/item_package_dimensions\",\n    \"value\": [\n      {\n        \"width\": {\n    