 and character to your décor. The sturdy wooden construction ensures long-lasting durability, and the open design keeps your favourite items within easy reach and beautifully on display. Whether used as a coffee mug rack, a display shelf for collectibles, or a stylish organiser, this wall shelf is a practical and decorative addition to any home.\",\n        \"language_tag\": \"en_IN\",\n        \"marketplace_id\": \"A21TJRUUN4KGV\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"op\": \"replace\",\n    \"path\": \"/attributes/shelf_bracket_shape\",\n    \"value\": [\n      {\n        \"value\": \"grid-like lattice design\",\n        \"language_tag\": \"en_IN\",\n        \"marketplace_id\": \"A21TJRUUN4KGV\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"op\": \"replace\",\n    \"path\": \"/attributes/is_assembly_required\",\n    \"value\": [\n      {\n        \"value\": true,\n        \"marketplace_id\": \"A21TJRUUN4KGV\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"op\": \"replace\",\n    \"path\": \"/attributes/assembly_instructions\",\n    \"value\": [\n      {\n        \"value\": \"Mount The Shelf On The Wall Using The Provided Hardware. Mark The Desired Position On The Wall, Drill Holes At The Marked Points, Insert Wall Plugs, And Secure The Shelf Using Screws. Ensure The Shelf Is Level Before Tightening Fully.\",\n        \"language_tag\": \"en_IN\",\n        \"marketplace_id\": \"A21TJRUUN4KGV\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"op\": \"replace\",\n    \"path\": \"/attributes/item_depth_width_height\",\n    \"value\": [\n      {\n        \"depth\": {\n          \"unit\": \"centimeters\",\n          \"value\": 10\n        },\n        \"width\": {\n          \"unit\": \"centimeters\",\n          \"value\": 61\n        },\n        \"height\": {\n          \"unit\": \"centimeters\",\n          \"value\": 61\n        },\n        \"marketplace_id\": \"A21TJRUUN4KGV\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"op\": \"replace\",\n    \"path\": \"/attributes/item_package_dimensions\",\n    \"value\": [\n      {\n